{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_aprl_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_aprl_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"猎人的视线","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aprl_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"0c004cb98ec897802264b441e3d96e9e035e19efec568e16cc97f7e91dfa70da","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，是我，爱尔莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚营地的广播你听到了吗？......对喔，我现在还在任务中，离钢铁萝卜城大概也就走个一天一夜的距离吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊！本来我以为这两天就可以回家了，结果今天接到新的通知，我们这支勘察队在中转站补给之后，还要去更远的矿区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，公司的队伍说走就走，安排我当护卫，我也没有什么办法呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这周的聚会我去不了啦，不好意思哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当然会觉得有点可惜啦，毕竟大家准备了这么久嘛。好不容易找到那间废弃的矿石仓库可以做场地，又花了那么大力气把它布置好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这样一看，还好我负责的工作前期就完成了呢，现在突然到不了场也不会误什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（难过）嗯，是哦，反正以后还有很多机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......下一次聚会的时候，天气应该就很暖和了呢，之前我们一起逛街的时候买的那条连衣裙总算可以穿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对吧，你也很期待吧？我还买了能搭配的耳饰呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，你们之前说排练了一首我喜欢的歌要在聚会上表演，但是要给我个惊喜，所以先不告诉我是哪首......现在总可以说了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我猜不到啦，我喜欢的乐队两只手都数不过来，每支乐队还有那么多好专辑，要我从中挑一首歌也太难了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不要再等下一次聚会啦，万一下次我又被公司安排长期任务了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喔，那首啊，确实很应景呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可要成为超级明星组合喔，那样我就可以实现在家门口看演唱会的心愿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不着痕迹地，卡特斯女孩突然用手捂住了通讯器的收音位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猎人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哇，那个花枝招展的小卡特斯？不会吧，她怎么在这儿，最近还有人敢委托任务给她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但她依然是注册猎人，原则上她是可以在营地停留的，虽然是独来独往......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，队伍要出发了呢，本来我还想跟你抱怨一下这次任务有多麻烦，看来只能下次再说啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我回到城里再联系你们咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猎人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是她的话，我就会识相地低下头赶快走掉。不过看她穿得那么惹眼，大概还是和以前一样不知好歹吧，哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，赶路的时候就把耳机戴上吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，清净多啦！为了不犯困，路上就听点动感的音乐吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，最近的价目表被我放在哪里了......啊，对，这里写了裂兽的价格最高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我也不会处理那种庞然大物呀......还是算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前只要把野兽赶走就好了，现在却要主动去树林里找它们的麻烦呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好只差一点点就攒够目标金额了，就算再捕几只羽兽，应该也够了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照公司福利政策，攒下来的钱差不多能买一台公司淘汰的旧投影仪了呢，那样就可以躺在床上看买来的影碟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，有钱的话，首先还是改善一下住宿条件吧。如果换间隔音好一点的出租屋，半夜出完任务回家或者搬动家具就不会吵到邻居了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我还是不太擅长做长线计划呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有动静了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道今天的运气怎么样呢......受伤的野兽总是会跑掉，从书上学来的陷阱也不知道好不好用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是人啊！好险好险——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你好——别认错啦，我不是猎物，我是猎人呀！我都穿得这么鲜艳了，应该不像野兽吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可没认错，你就是我们的猎物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"值钱的东西都交出来，不然别怪我们不客气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，好像真的有其他人靠过来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在那边树上的，我背后石头旁边的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒数三次，乖乖把钱拿来。否则，就不是一支箭这么简单的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"三。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"二。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些钱可是我好不容易攒下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不你们还是试试看能不能追上我吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，爱尔莉，你又过来啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，今天总算把家里收拾完啦。没想到我的房间不大，杂七杂八的东西还挺多的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来看看......哎呀，这种可拆卸式的收纳柜，二手货不太容易卖出去的哦？而且上面还有胶带留下的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那是我之前在柜子侧面贴了可以当等身镜用的镜面贴纸，后来有天心情不好，就把它撕掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是不太美观呢......那您就估价低一点吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这件衣服还是全新的，你要当二手货卖掉吗？是不是有点太可惜了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有点惋惜呢......不过这件衣服的款式不太合适，会露出后背，所以没办法啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你的矿石病，石头是长在后背上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我明白的。爱尔莉，你刚搬过来没多久吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看你连续好几天跑到这边来卖东西了，是遇到什么紧急情况了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里都是感染者，有些话我们悄悄说，没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没事，老板。我只是在这里一直找不到工作，所以想换个地方试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些东西反正也带不走，干脆就卖掉好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，说是换个地方，别的地方就能好过吗？你想好去哪里了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......在广告上看到了一家公司，虽然有点远，但我觉得可以去试一试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经为新城市的生活存好一笔钱啦，接下来只要手里的钱够买长途车票就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，之前我认真计划了一下，手头还是挺宽裕的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且就算现在没有工作，我还有这把弓呢。运气好的时候能在城市周边捕到一些野兽，营地也会有收购皮毛和兽肉的商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"运气差一点的话......应该也不会饿死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你年纪轻轻的，打猎时可千万小心，遇到源石晶簇一定要绕着走......别让病情恶化得太快啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我都跟着采矿车队这么多年了，怎么会不知道这些呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过原本想着攒下来一点钱的话先买个二手音箱或者投影仪什么的，没想到第一次手头有钱会是这个感觉的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，东西都卖光了，好像不能说是变得有钱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货市场老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然这么多东西都拖出来卖掉了，那你应该马上就要离开了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，明天早上就出发啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你们两个拿刀的家伙跑得真快啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我的行李包交出去的话，我就真的什么都没有了......感觉那样也很难活下去呢，还是算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然还是运气不太好啊，要不是买长途车票差一点点钱，又不想动用封存好的那笔生活费的话，本来不用再打猎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我说得这么大声，你们应该也听得到吧？我还以为你们会同情一下我呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在几乎被强盗手中的刀刃触及的瞬间，灵活的卡特斯猛然跃起，攀上一根树枝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，看来陷阱是有用的呢，而且连那边的弩手都踩到机关掉进捕兽网了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有想过要跟人战斗啦，不过现在你们落进了陷阱，就算是猎物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我虽然年纪不大，但很早就开始接受猎人的职业训练了哦，对于自己的弓箭，还有引诱猎物的手段，我还是很自信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，因为陷阱是用来对付野兽的嘛，所以挣扎得越用力，越容易受伤哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这样的威胁应该够了吧？电视剧里好像都是这么演的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，不知道附近有没有治安队，或者哪家公司的专业安保人员，等会儿去营地求助试试看吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......现在我们应该可以悠闲地聊天了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......你要做什么？先把弓放下来，我们有话好好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是确认一下陷阱够不够可靠，没什么问题的话，我就要回营地找人把你们带走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的强盗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不行，求你......我们会死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这么怕被抓，难道你们已经抢过很多人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的强盗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们是得了病的人。是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一点就够了，猎人。你说自己不跟人战斗，但你不会同情牲畜，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"与其花时间给感染者定罪，不如直接......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猎人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果在以前，我还会说那家伙毫无猎人的素养，但是现在她是感染者了，那可不能再把她跟我们放在一起比较了，哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猎人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是注册猎人有什么关系，现在还有谁找她做事吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们为什么会来当强盗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么好问的？感染了矿石病，工作丢了，但总得想办法活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和大部分感染者一样，我们兄弟三个之前也是矿工，都干得挺久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......公司的保障措施呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是说感染者补偿金？被我们那个矿井负责人私吞了吧。我没听说有哪个一起干活的人感染后收到过自己的补偿金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看你穿得这么光鲜，难道是什么没见过感染者的有钱人家大小姐？如果你要找个地方施舍自己的同情心，我这里悲惨故事多的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是普通人，非常普通......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我倒是有个想法。既然你们知道是谁拿走了你们的补偿金，为什么不找他本人拿回来呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我是这次被安排来临时执行护送任务的猎人，这是我的注册猎人证明，然后这是临时委任文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我不记得见过你，而且我们的猎人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，我还有三位同伴，会协助我完成任务哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别胡闹，哪有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"持刀的强盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是想要回我们的钱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别、别把刀架在......救、救命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不要想着呼救，我们被矿场抛弃之后，可是实打实地干了好几票抢劫，刀不会慢的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......这样真的能行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我先去营地打听一下，寻找最近会前往那处矿场的猎人，大致了解一下任务情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢，如果对方是个好心人，愿意帮助我们，那我们就顶替对方进入矿场。如果对方不愿意帮忙，我们就提前以他的名义混进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我其实也不太会编谎话，到时候你们可能要帮我打圆场哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从守卫那里通过之后，路上只要避开所有人就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来倒是容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我是猎人嘛，在不被发现这方面还是很有心得的，野兽的感官那么灵敏，我都能躲过它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被看到了，那就再想办法嘛，我觉得我们长得也不是很可疑，陌生人就算看到了我们也不会记住吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，好吧，那我带路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......猎人，你到底为什么要帮我们？因为我们看起来太可怜了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这倒没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能只是因为我有个问题想找人问问看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，关于你私吞感染者补偿金这件事，我是不是还可以向公司举报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，我给，我给就是了......全部给你们补上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不要承诺什么支票之类的东西，我们只要实实在在的钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是信任你，我们当初就会站在这里等着你把钱拿出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......现金，那边的保险箱......这是钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......你去拿，就拿三人份的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的强盗","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"好......我们不能多拿一点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"以防万一被查到。而且，在这家伙面前我希望有尊严一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明明就是感染者，谈什么尊严......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边的猎人也够奇怪的。我以为你也是来讨要补偿金的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我只是想问一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你并不缺钱，为什么要拿走感染者赖以生存的这笔补偿金呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿井负责人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......反正没有后续就业机会，这笔钱迟早会被你们用光吧？把钱花在感染者身上，多浪费啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"真让人恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"猎人，你费这么大劲就为了问这个问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，也不是啦，只是之前我都没想过这件事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是谁夺走了公司给我的福利，又是为什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们接下来想再回附近的城镇碰碰运气，也许还有用得着我们的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不打算去找那些害了你的人算账？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好像没办法呢。因为一开始就没注意是不是有人从中使坏，所以现在也完全不知道要去找谁问个清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我已经准备离开这里啦，就把过去的事情全部抛下好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你之前说过在凑车票钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你帮了我们这么大的忙，还花了好几天时间，我们替你把剩下的车票钱凑齐作为报答吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然也不是多大的数目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你们果然也是很好的人嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，没想到你也是感染者，而且你跑到那个混账东西面前，居然只是想问那么简单的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"听到那种话，你难道就满意了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不满意啦，他说的话我一点也不喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是很多人都是那样想的吧？其实根本不需要什么理由，只是不用把感染者当回事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就连我自己也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器那端的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，爱尔莉，你居然接了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器那端的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是想呼叫你试试，没想到你居然真的在信号区内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器那端的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，能听到吗？这边在演奏《四月》哦！虽然他们演奏得乱七八糟的，但勉强还能听出来是什么，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器那端的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，这样你也算是没错过了！送给我们的爱尔莉，感谢你为钢铁萝卜城最伟大的艺术街区打下第一块基石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱尔莉，如果你要亲口跟他们道别，这就是最后的机会了。\n如果你想问问你的朋友们接不接受一个感染者，这也是最好的机会了，趁着你还没有远走高飞，你们的关系还很热络。\n——这样想着的卡特斯，只是安静地握着通讯器听完了整首歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......替我转达一下，我觉得如果他们多多练习，音乐还是可以变得好听的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，就这样吧。你们一定要玩得开心哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那几个感染者已经走掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果之后有机会的话，我再写信把我的事情告诉朋友们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟成为感染者之后，我就没怎么感受过这样的热情和善意了......我还是想让他们再多陪陪我呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是说到底，比起别人的看法，最重要的还是......我自己怎么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱尔莉","speakerId":"avg_365_aprl_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啦，该出发了。希望那家公司的广告不是虚假宣传呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
